                "text": "Thank you to the @HanoverTownship Senior Center for welcoming me to your Meals on Wheels program, which helps deliver nutritious food to older Americans in our communities. \n\nThe recent cuts to federal funding, including the Republican Big Ugly Bill's cuts to Medicaid and SNAP, endanger food programs across the country. In Congress, I am fighting to expand the funding for the Older Americans Act and defend every program that helps seniors live with dignity.",
