                "text": "Need help navigating Medicare enrollment? \n\nMy team is hosting two Medicare Info Session and Enrollment Workshops this October! Come join us in Chicago or DuPage, where we will be providing hands-on support and connecting you to additional resources and services. \n\nNo registration needed!",
