                "text": "Community healthcare centers provides quality affordable health care for people throughout the Chicago area, including IL-03.\n\nAs Republicans continue to threaten the health care of millions of Americans, I met with health providers and community leaders to discuss the importance of providing accessible medical services to our communities.",
