                "text": "Medicare open enrollment period will go until December 7, 2025!\n\nI know the enrollment process can be confusing. That\u2019s why my office held Medicare enrollment workshops to walk our constituents through the process. Thank you to everyone who joined!\n\nIf you need help with a federal agency, call my office. We are here to assist you.",
